@name: AI-verified checkout
@tags: e2e, ai-assertion
@description: Uses a `verify ai:` semantic check instead of literal text matching

@use login.runly with user=standard_user pass=secret_sauce

click add to cart for sauce labs backpack
click add to cart for sauce labs onesie
click cart icon

verify ai: both the backpack and the onesie are present in the cart

click checkout button
type Ritik in first name field
type Pal in last name field
type 560001 in zip code field
click continue button

verify ai: the total price equals the sum of individual item prices plus tax
